+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
+<title>afree locale test</title>
+<style>
+  body { font-family: sans-serif; margin: 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
+  h2 { margin-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 8px; }
+  label { display: block; margin: 6px 0; }
+  input { min-width: 220px; }
+  .hint { color: #0a0; }
+  .warn { color: #a00; }
+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<h1>afree locale test</h1>
+<p class="hint">
+  This page exercises Blink's <b>localized native UI</b>. Launch it with e.g.
+  <code>-e url "file:///android_asset/locale_test.html" --es cr '--lang=ru'</code>
+  and check that the media menu / validation messages below are localized.
+</p>
+<p id="env" class="hint"></p>
+
+<h2>1. HTML5 media controls — simulated pattern (local test.mp4)</h2>
+<video controls src="file:///android_asset/media/test.mp4"
+       style="width:80%;max-width:1000px;max-height:55vh;height:auto;background:#000"></video>
+<p></p>
+<audio controls src="data:audio/wav;base64,"></audio>
+
+<h2>1b. movie.mp4 — remote first, fallback to bundled local asset</h2>
+<video id="movieRemote" controls
+       style="width:80%;max-width:1000px;max-height:55vh;height:auto;background:#000"
+       src="https://static.jyshare.com/video/movie.mp4"
+       data-local="file:///android_asset/media/movie.mp4"></video>
+<p class="hint" id="movieRemoteState">src: https://static.jyshare.com/video/movie.mp4</p>
+
+<h2>1c. movie.mp4 — bundled local file (file:///android_asset/media/movie.mp4)</h2>
+<video controls
+       style="width:80%;max-width:1000px;max-height:55vh;height:auto;background:#000"
+       src="file:///android_asset/media/movie.mp4"></video>
+
+<h2>2. Form validation (Blink localized messages)</h2>
+<form id="f" onsubmit="return false;">
+  <label>Required text: <input name="req" required></label>
+  <label>Email: <input name="email" type="email"></label>
+  <label>URL: <input name="url" type="url"></label>
+  <label>Number (1..10, step 1): <input name="num" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="100"></label>
+  <label>Pattern [A-Z]{3}: <input name="pat" pattern="[A-Z]{3}" value="abc"></label>
+  <label>Date: <input name="d" type="date"></label>
+  <label>Month: <input name="m" type="month"></label>
+  <label>Week: <input name="w" type="week"></label>
+  <label>Time: <input name="t" type="time"></label>
+  <p>
+    <button type="submit" form="f">Submit (native validation)</button>
+    <button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('f').reportValidity()">reportValidity()</button>
+  </p>
+</form>
+
+<h2>3. &lt;details&gt; without summary</h2>
+<details><p>details content</p></details>
+
+<h2>4. beforeunload (native dialog)</h2>
+<p class="warn">Clicking the button below registers beforeunload and navigates away.</p>
+<button type="button" onclick="location.href='about:blank'">Navigate away (beforeunload)</button>
+
+<script>
+  document.getElementById('env').textContent =
+    'navigator.language=' + navigator.language +
+    '  html.lang=' + document.documentElement.lang;
+
+  // movie.mp4: use the remote URL if reachable, otherwise fall back to the
+  // bundled local asset (file:///android_asset/media/movie.mp4).
+  (function () {
+    var rv = document.getElementById('movieRemote');
+    if (!rv) return;
+    var st = document.getElementById('movieRemoteState');
+    var isLocal = function () { return rv.src.indexOf('android_asset') >= 0; };
+    rv.addEventListener('error', function () {
+      if (!isLocal()) { rv.src = rv.dataset.local; st.textContent = 'remote failed -> local: ' + rv.src; }
+    });
+    rv.addEventListener('loadeddata', function () {
+      st.textContent = (isLocal() ? 'local OK: ' : 'remote OK: ') + rv.src;
+    });
+  })();
+  window.addEventListener('beforeunload', function (e) {
+    e.preventDefault();
+    e.returnValue = '';
+  });
+</script>
+</body>
+</html>
